# AI Agent Exclusion Rules
# Files and patterns that AI agents should ignore or handle carefully

## Ignore These Directories (Generated/Build Output)
app/build/
.gradle/
.idea/
captures/
local.properties

## Ignore These File Types
*.class
*.jar
*.aar
*.dex
*.apk
*.aab
*.so
*.iml
*.hprof
*.log
*.png
*.jpg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg

## Handle Carefully (Don't Modify Unless Explicitly Requested)
app/src/main/res/values/colors.xml
app/src/main/res/values/themes.xml
app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml
app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
app/build.gradle.kts
build.gradle.kts
settings.gradle.kts
gradle.properties

## Never Auto-Commit
*.keystore
*.jks
google-services.json
local.properties
secrets.properties
**/secrets.*
**/api-keys.*
